[60.022936, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[1;35mIncidents That Would Page Someone at 3 AM\u001b[0m                                                           \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m 1 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mPayments API (Error / CrashLoopBackOff)\u001b[0m:                                                         \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mReason\u001b[0m: Critical functionality for processing transactions. If payments are down, it directly \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m   \u001b[0mimpacts revenue and user trust. This would trigger an urgent alert and require immediate      \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m   \u001b[0mattention.                                                                                    \r\r\n\u001b[36m 2 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mInventory Service (No Endpoints)\u001b[0m:                                                                \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mReason\u001b[0m: High user impact. If inventory data is unavailable, users cannot see product          \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m   \u001b[0mavailability, which disrupts shopping. This would likely page someone, especially if the shop \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m   \u001b[0mis live and users are active.                                                                 \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[2m----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1;35mIncidents That Can Wait Until Morning\u001b[0m                                                               \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m 1 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mCheckout Pods (ImagePullBackOff)\u001b[0m:                                                                \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mReason\u001b[0m: Medium impact. While checkout is important,                                           "]
